2026-11-01  Mark A. Hershberger  <mah@everybody.org>

	Fix the Emacs cache restore and the auth-source password lookup.

	* mediawiki-site.el (mediawiki-site-password): Ask auth-source for an
	entry that actually has a secret before falling back to
	`url-password-for-url', which stops at the first entry for the host
	and so can return nil even when a password is stored.  This makes
	"leave the password empty and use auth-source" work as documented.

	* .github/workflows/test.yml: Build and cache Emacs next to the
	checkout instead of /opt.  The runner cannot write /opt, so a cache
	hit restored nothing and there was no `emacs' on PATH.  The prefix is
	computed in each step because `runner.workspace' is not available in
	a job-level env.

